TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Uykuya kolay dalarım ama çok kıpırdarım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
o yüzden o koca yatağı bilerek seçtim!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tatile çıktığımda bile{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} oteli yatağın
büyüklüğüne göre seçerim!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}C'est mon nouveau joujou,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} nouvelle
génération{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Quand je veux boire mon café en
solitaire, c'est parfait !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je t'en
propose pas, j'ai plus de capsules.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ecco qua nientepopodimeno che
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
dell'ultima generazione{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
Che aroma! Troppo buono!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Certo, non è un caffè professionale
come quello della caffetteria{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ma per essere casalingo è OK!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mi avevano detto che oggigiorno
i computer "fanno anche il caffè",
quindi ne ho comprato uno, ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}... non fa il caffè!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi hanno
imbrogliato!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Rivoglio indietro
i miei soldi, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Şimdilerde bilgisayarlarla neredeyse her
şeyi yapabiliyorlarmış diye duydum, ben de
bir tane aldım.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Şu alete en ufak bir şeyi nasıl
